# Gravewell Shaft's trial bore (CIPlay gravewell_shaft_caves, 11-11 w06; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in the
# recipe (island frame, 45 m down): the pit's floor at 1, the drift's mouth in the pit's wall at -2.5 4.33 (the stair's
# gap at 330 degrees), level out by -3 5.2 and -6.2 7.2 to the bore's chamber -8.5 8.5 .. -11.3 11.3 (air zone
# gw_trialbore at -9.9 9.9), back out along the drift. below= keeps the walker under the drift's roof.
island Gravewell Shaft keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

picture gw_bore_out -0.5 3 0.5 -3 2.5 5.2
walk -1 3.2 to -2.5 4.33 to -3.4 5.89 to -6.2 7.2 to -8.5 8.5 to -9.9 9.9 below=4
air gw_trialbore here
picture gw_bore_in -5.5 3 6.8 -11.3 2.5 11.3 light=20
air gw_trialbore
# Back out along the drift into the pit
walk -9.9 9.9 to -8.5 8.5 to -6.2 7.2 to -3.4 5.89 to -2.5 4.33 to -1 3.2 below=4
picture gw_bore_mouth 0.5 2.6 0.8 -3.4 2.2 5.9
